{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"choral-fab-dairycow","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Reproduction Steps\n\nRun `rebar fsck` against the current `origin/tickets` store after commit f2837f0a8. The command exits nonzero and reports 561 diagnostics: 550 `SNAPSHOT_STALE_CHANNEL`, 10 `ORPHAN_EVENT`, and 1 `STATUS_FORK_RESOLVED`. The same 561-count baseline was observed immediately before and after story 3036-cb14-86b5-44a3 removed `.bridge_state.bak-retarget`, so that deletion did not introduce them.\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n\n- Expected: `rebar fsck` exits cleanly with zero store-integrity diagnostics.\n- Actual: 561 pre-existing diagnostics remain. The stale-channel repair mechanism exists, but the live store has not been remediated.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Each diagnostic class is triaged and its safe repair path is documented.\n- [ ] Repairs preserve every reachable ticket and retained event required by the event model.\n- [ ] A fresh `rebar fsck` run reports zero diagnostics.\n- [ ] The repair and before/after counts are recorded on this ticket.","id":"30d3-eaf0-c7a4-497a","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["fsck","store-integrity"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Remediate 561 pre-existing fsck diagnostics in the tickets store"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785604110755186001,"uuid":"8b81f8ca-2de8-4d8d-bd92-eb9e886c3156"}